{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkxkKcnvaSFsZPNgcofa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going with **Psagot**: open a securities account there and buy **\"אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A)\"** every month. I'm fairly sure. The thing that settled it was the big box at the top, \"הבחירה שלכם · ★ הזול\", which says **86,045 ₪** is left after 10 years. It's cheaper than the other bank-and-fund pairs and the page picked it for me. Psagot is a name I know, so that's fine. First step is to open an account there. The page doesn't say how.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **The heading** \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן\" is exactly my question, so I stayed. \"ת\"א-125\" was already picked.\n- **The sliders** were on 10,000 ₪ up front and 500 a month for 10 years. The first slider's knob is already at the far right, so I doubt it goes up to my 30,000. I didn't touch any of them.\n- **The first big number** was \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\". Next to it was the cheap pick at 86,045 ₪, and the next-best pair at 85,015 ₪ with \"‎-1,030 ₪\".\n- **The cost bars** said 7,323 ₪ against 8,353 ₪ over 10 years.\n- **The fund box** said \"דמי ניהול 0.1%\". That sounds like nothing.\n- **The bank list** has Psagot at number 1, then Leumi, Discount and so on. Lower down the bars turn red. I scrolled past it fast.\n- **Further down** were \"מה הכי משנה את מה שיישאר לכם\" with a chart, then \"מתחילים מבחירה אחת…\" with a step chart that starts at \"עכשיו 79,910 ₪\" for Harel Sal with Jerusalem. I don't have that, so I don't get why it's \"עכשיו\". There's a long table after it. I didn't read any of that, or the grey notes at the bottom.\n\n**What bugged me:**\n- **The minus signs.** The fund list shows \"‎-0.04%\" even next to the fund I'm meant to choose. It looks like I'm losing money. The other rows say \"‎-1,030 ₪\", \"‎-1,113 ₪\".\n- **Costs I couldn't match up.** Psagot says \"1,049 ₪\" for the account, but the bar says 7,323 ₪. Which one is what I pay? I didn't work it out.\n- **The bar colours.** The legend is tiny. I guessed the big pink part is tax.\n- **Words I didn't get:** \"דמי משמרת\", \"נאמן\", \"צוברת\", \"מחקה\" vs \"קרן סל\", \"4A\", \"מול המדד\".\n- **The bank list.** It's very long, and every bank has the same small print about \"מחיר אחר לצעירים, לחיילים…\". I'd have quit the scroll there."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6173,"cache_read_input_tokens":11618,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6173},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9fc9dc44-d5bd-487e-b99c-419c0d3f7571","uuid":"0a932a7c-e2d5-466b-8563-aa2b3641fd26","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:26:43.539Z","request_id":"req_011CgkxkKPuFqvUgwN2YSaBt"}
